hierarchy measured from Origami’s runner render: a full-screen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"purple canvas, an inset rounded interaction area, and a centered draggable card."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The card maps the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" Position output to its SwiftUI offset. A release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"projects momentum and applies rubber-band bounds. If its touch-up position is within"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"100 points of center on both axes, the placed graph’s Reset branch pulses Drag’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Reset input and returns the card to its origin."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/fileImporter(isPresented:allowedContentTypes:allowsMultipleSelection:onCompletion:onCancellation:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/fileImporter(isPresented:allowedContentTypes:allowsMultipleSelection:onCompletion:onCancellation:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fileImporter","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"isPresented","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"allowedContentTypes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:22UniformTypeIdentifiers6UTTypeV","text":"UTType","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"allowsMultipleSelection","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onCompletion","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"}